  "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nThis **high-priority** release updates Lighthouse's trusted certificates to mitigate the compromised eMudhra certificate authority. All Lighthouse users on all networks should upgrade as soon as practical. Upgrading promptly is recommended, especially if your setup utilises HTTPS (e.g. for checkpoint sync, web3signer, VC to BN connections).\r\n\r\nAs a reminder: all Hoodi users must upgrade to v8.3.x prior to Monday 26 Oct 2026. Please see v8.3.0's release notes for details if you are upgrading from v8.2.x:\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/sigp/lighthouse/releases/tag/v8.3.0\r\n\r\n## Update Priority\r\n\r\nThis table provides priorities for which classes of users should update particular components.\r\n\r\n|User Class |Beacon Node  | Validator Client|\r\n--- | --- | ---\r\n|Staking Users| High | High |\r\n|Non-Staking Users| Medium | --- |\r\n\r\n*See [Update Priorities](https://lighthouse-book.sigmaprime.io/installation_priorities.html) more information about this table.*\r\n\r\n## All Changes\r\n\r\n- Release v8.3.1\r\n- Fix CI audit failure (#10407)\r\n\r\n## Binaries\r\n\r\n[See pre-built binaries documentation.](https://lighthouse-book.sigmaprime.io/installation_binaries.html)\r\n\r\nThe binaries are signed with Sigma Prime's PGP key: `15E66D941F697E28F49381F426416DC3F30674B0`\r\n\r\n| System | Architecture | Binary | PGP Signature |\r\n|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---|\r\n| <picture> <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/apple/white\" > <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/apple\" ><img src=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/apple\" width=\"32\" alt=\"Apple logo\">  </picture> | aarch64 | [lighthouse-v8.3.1-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz](https://github.com/sigp/lighthouse/releases/download/v8.3.1/lighthouse-v8.3.1-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz) | [PGP Signature](https://github.com/sigp/lighthouse/releases/download/v8.3.1/lighthouse-v8.3.1-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz.asc) |\r\n| <picture> <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/linux/white\" > <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/linux/black\" ><img src=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/linux\" width=\"32\" alt=\"Linux logo\"> </picture> | x86_64 | [lighthouse-v8.3.1-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz](https://github.com/sigp/lighthouse/releases/download/v8.3.1/lighthouse-v8.3.1-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz) | [PGP Signature](https://github.com/sigp/lighthouse/releases/download/v8.3.1/lighthouse-v8.3.1-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.asc) |\r\n| <picture> <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/raspberrypi/white\" > <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/raspberrypi/black\" > <img src=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/raspberrypi\" width=\"32\" alt=\"Raspberrypi logo\"> </picture> | aarch64 | [lighthouse-v8.3.1-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz](https://github.com/sigp/lighthouse/releases/download/v8.3.1/lighthouse-v8.3.1-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz) | [PGP Signature](https://github.com/sigp/lighthouse/releases/download/v8.3.1/lighthouse-v8.3.1-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.asc) |\r\n| | | | |\r\n| **System** | **Option** | - | **Resource** |\r\n| <picture> <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/docker/white\" > <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/docker/black\" > <img src=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/docker/black\" width=\"32\" alt=\"Docker logo\"></picture>  | Docker | [v8.3.1](https://hub.docker.com/r/sigp/lighthouse/tags?page=1&ordering=last_updated&name=v8.3.1) | [sigp/lighthouse](https://hub.docker.com/r/sigp/lighthouse) |\r\n",
